      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm surprised by the amount of people having issues with the custom bindings. In your vrchat settings are you using Vive Advanced Controls? With that setting toggled on movement and gestures are separate so the joysticks should not interfere.\n\nPersonally I've only ever tested my published bindings with the advanced controls because that is all I use in vrchat. This may be the issue with all the other top bindings that everyone uses if the different settings result in different behaviour.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
