      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5da4ecc441f64735c05ee008|full_name}: completely agreed, however I was referring to the other issues people are having as I think any binding should work but the user needs to have Advanced Vive Controls active in vrchat to correctly get the joysticks input. Otherwise I do agree with you.\n\nIt is actually quite frustrating that the Index controllers were so quickly adopted but the WMR controls for in game have not been corrected for multiple years. Pretty sure the game does detect them as WMR controllers as it replaces the models in the loading screen, as far as I am aware though they have done nothing beyond that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
