  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-10-25T00:08:01.494Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The problem is not that it is not playable currently but it is not nice. You have to select a custom control sheme so that you can use the joysticks to move but these just emulate klickes on the touchpad aka when you run/turn all your facial animation cancel. What i suggest is that you can use the joystick as a seperate input that does not emulate a touchpad. That is all that is needed",
